      "message": "I believe it\u0027s worth explaining _why_ INTEL_IOMMU_FLOPPY_WA is a problem with pKVM (i.e. that pKVM forbids donating pages that are mapped in IOMMU page tables, while INTEL_IOMMU_FLOPPY_WA maps those first 16MB in IOMMU page tables but does not prevent them from being used by the host kernel\u0027s buddy allocator and thus potentially allocated for donating to a pVM or to hypervisor).",
